claim.claim-text:
a display;
a first communicator configured to wirelessly pair with a wireless ultrasound probe;
a second communicator configured to receive ultrasound image data from the wireless ultrasound probe; and
a controller configured to:

in response to receiving a first user input for searching a wireless ultrasound probe, controlling a first communicator to output a pairing signal;
in response to the first communicator being paired with the wireless ultrasound probe and receiving identification (ID) information of the paired wireless ultrasound probe, controlling a display to display the ID information of the paired wireless ultrasound probe; and
in response to receiving a second user input for activating the paired wireless ultrasound probe, controlling the first communicator or a second communicator to transmit an activation signal to the paired wireless ultrasound probe and controlling the second communicator to receive an ultrasound image data from the paired wireless ultrasound probe.
